-| IOMMU: VT-d, AMD-Vi, SMMUv3, domains, faults | 19 | 6,126 | yes |
-| Objects, handles and IPC: pipes, messages, ports, namespaces, events, inboxes, the watch | 22 | 5,751 | yes, but the TTY mark (below) |
