-The kernel also links the crates beside it, whose lines carry their host
-tests: `kernel/pure` (49 files, 26,108, the scheduler core 15,570 of it),
-`kernel/proclife` (3,550), `kernel/pci` (2,211), `kernel/smmu` (1,463),
